
# --- Optional: an OpenAI-compatible LLM for the agent modules ---------------
# Nothing in this repository requires one. Unset, the agent modules use their
# rule-based behaviour, which is what they have always done.
#
# Set these in your SHELL, not in a committed file. A key in a file gets
# committed eventually, and this repository is public.
#
#   export LLM_API_KEY=...
#   export LLM_BASE_URL=https://api.z.ai/api/paas/v4     # Z.ai general
#   export LLM_MODEL=glm-5.2
#
# Other known OpenAI-compatible bases:
#   https://api.z.ai/api/coding/paas/v4   Z.ai coding plan
#   https://api.openai.com/v1             OpenAI
#
# Separately, Claude Code itself can be pointed at Z.ai's Anthropic-compatible
# endpoint before launch. That routes your whole session through them:
#   export ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL=https://api.z.ai/api/anthropic
#   export ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN=...
